  titulo: BREAKING NEWS - System Malfunction Kills Many People
  textoConteudo: 'During this evening the drones and androids patrolling the park
    suffered a malfunction that lead to death of many innocent civilian people.


    Civilian
    Survivor Statement:


    "The drones turned their weapons toward the crowd.
    At first everyone thought it was a demonstration. Then the shooting started."'
